on distboy me
  [  0] getglobal 83 ............................ <goody>
  [  2] getchainedprop 105 ...................... <goody.pos>
  [  4] getprop 105 ............................. <pos>
  [  6] pusharglist 2 ........................... <goody.pos, pos>
